{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Com[C]fort, [F]com[C]fort [Dm]ye [Am]My [Bb]peo[F]ple,
[Dm]Speak [C]ye [F]peace, [Bb]thus [F]saith__[C7]__ our [F]God;
[F]Com[C]fort [F]those [C]who [Dm]sit [Am]in [Bb]dark[F]ness,
[Dm]Mourn[C]ing [F]’neath [Bb]their [F]sor__[C7]__row’s [F]load;
[F]Speak [Dm]ye to [Bb]Jeru[C]sa[F]lem
[F]Of the [Bb]peace [C]that [Bb]waits [F]for [C]them;
[F]Tell [Cm]her [Gm]that her [Dm]sins [C]I [F]co[Bb]ver,
[F]And [Dm]her [Bb]war[F]fare [Gm]now is [C7]o[F]ver.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]For [C]the [F]her[C]ald’s [Dm]voice [Am]is [Bb]cry[F]ing
[Dm]In [C]the [F]des[Bb]ert [F]far__[C7]__ and [F]near,
[F]Bid[C]ding [F]all [C]men [Dm]to [Am]re[Bb]pent[F]ance,
[Dm]Since [C]the [F]king[Bb]dom [F]now__[C7]__ is [F]here.
[F]O [Dm]that warn[Bb]ing [F]cry [C]o[F]bey!
[F]Now pre[Bb]pare [C]for [Bb]God [F]a [C]way!
[F]Let [Cm]the [Gm]valleys [Dm]rise [C]to [F]meet [Bb]Him,
[F]And [Dm]the [Bb]hills [F]bow [Gm]down to [C7]greet [F]Him.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Yea, [C]her [F]sins [C]our [Dm]God [Am]will [Bb]par[F]don,
[Dm]Blot[C]ting [F]out [Bb]each [F]dark__[C7]__ mis[F]deed;
[F]All [C]that [F]well [C]de[Dm]served [Am]His [Bb]an[F]ger
[Dm]He [C]will [F]no [Bb]more [F]see__[C7]__ nor [F]heed.
[F]She [Dm]has suff[Bb]ered [F]many [C]a [F]day,
[F]Now her [Bb]griefs [C]have [Bb]passed [F]a[C]way,
[F]God [Cm]will [Gm]change her [Dm]pi[C]ning [F]sad[Bb]ness
[F]In[Dm]to [Bb]ev[F]er [Gm]springing [C7]glad[F]ness.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F]Make [C]ye [F]straight [C]what [Dm]long [Am]was [Bb]crook[F]ed,
[Dm]Make [C]the [F]rough[Bb]er [F]pla__[C7]__ces [F]plain:
[F]Let [C]your [F]hearts [C]be [Dm]true [Am]and [Bb]hum[F]ble,
[Dm]As [C]be[F]fits [Bb]His [F]ho__[C7]__ly [F]reign,
[F]For [Dm]the glo[Bb]ry [F]of [C]the [F]Lord
[F]O'er the [Bb]earth [C]is [Bb]shed [F]a[C]broad,
[F]And [Cm]all [Gm]flesh shall [Dm]see [C]the [F]to[Bb]ken
[F]That [Dm]His [Bb]Word [F]is [Gm]never [C7]bro[F]ken.
{end_of_verse}
